{
 "_about": "ASSET-002 Rootstalker kitbash: every add-on is a vanilla mesh (Hive lumps with our per-vertex offsets) on one Wolf bone (or skinned, see mode). For each part: create an ANCHOR as a child of `parent` with localPosition/localRotation/localScale (Runic armor_attach convention: localScale 1/BSCALE cancels the Wolf's bone-chain scale, localRotation undoes the bone's REST rotation, so the anchor is world-aligned in the rest pose), then a child carrying the vanilla mesh with `part_localRotation` / `part_localScale` (Unity axes) at position 0. Units: Unity, the Wolf prefab's REST pose.",
 "_donor": "Wolf (1.0.21, bundle c4210710)",
 "_bone_chain_scale": 1.500000089408959,
 "_base_tris": {
  "M": 1962
 },
